  "description": "500 answer-engine question units on Black culture \u2014 each with a primary question, a cited direct answer (31-55 words), a 5-question cluster, keywords, a Wikidata QID or an honest NONE marker, and a dated verification note (2026-11-04). Assembled from the verified KG333 (333) and FC300 (167) registries. Citation statuses are the dataset's evidence vocabulary: 321 rows rest on Wikipedia/Wikidata, 88 fictional characters carry franchise coverage only, and 11 rows are GAPs where CultureTechLens is the source of record and no external page exists.",
  "keywords": [
    "AEO",
    "answer engine optimization",
    "Black culture",
    "cited questions",
    "Wikidata",
    "FAQ schema",
    "CultureTechLens"
  ],
